  "body": "The XHR spec defines \"entry list\" and \"entry\" in the context of the `FormData` interface, which used to be slightly different from the HTML form submission algorithm's \"form data set\". After #3687, these concepts merged together, but were still defined in XHR, even though their primary use is in defining the form submission, rather than `FormData`. HTML also has many usages of \"entry list\" that don't reference anything.\r\n\r\nSo we should consider moving the definitions for \"entry list\", \"entry\", \"(entry) name\", \"(entry) value\", and \"create an entry\" into HTML.",
